      "jp": "宗教国家ロシェルにて、私は常々\n聖女としてモンスター娘様を崇拝していた。",
      "jp_sha256": "74cf7060f746f0c6aab9810cb988890664395e12415877946cb7bb8439231a56",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "종교 국가 로셸에서 나는 언제나\n성녀로서 몬스터 소녀님을 숭배해 왔다.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 14,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "9497a5804cf6d6776e1c95a88c40e70c7ac8d6e23986ba68b865e2b585ec4730:000000_-4531272953297824760:g0:r13",
      "row_index_0based": 13,
      "serialized_row_index": 13,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "宗教国家ロシェルにて、私は常々\n聖女としてモンスター娘様を崇拝していた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "7a4200ae92ffd66073a92e6741dd03df967350b65512ffba7c4cb623feae85c8",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "人智を超越した神の遣い――純白の翼と滑らかな髪、\nそして美しい瞳。",
      "jp_sha256": "92c1a240c2d3774b856e299e44a907d6523cc951f1771dcd7d6b966fae81a16c",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "인간의 지혜를 초월한 신의 사자――새하얀 날개와 매끄러운 머리카락,\n그리고 아름다운 눈동자.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 15,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "9497a5804cf6d6776e1c95a88c40e70c7ac8d6e23986ba68b865e2b585ec4730:000000_-4531272953297824760:g0:r14",
      "row_index_0based": 14,
      "serialized_row_index": 14,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "人智を超越した神の遣い――純白の翼と滑らかな髪、\nそして美しい瞳。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "c8e52fbaf586612f456fe73ecef258886fea71aba42ed21b0dca3398c12b1510",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "そう、モンスター娘様とは、あのマイネートー様のような\n存在をさすのだと、私はそう信じていた。それなのに――。",
      "jp_sha256": "0287a819de58e4f89e44c6d7f4be10f3ef2f8a5aa41548fcaadfc4ca1c0b24f6",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그래, 몬스터 소녀님이란 마이네토 님과 같은\n존재를 가리킨다고 나는 믿었다. 그런데――.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 25,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "9497a5804cf6d6776e1c95a88c40e70c7ac8d6e23986ba68b865e2b585ec4730:000000_-4531272953297824760:g0:r24",
      "row_index_0based": 24,
      "serialized_row_index": 24,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "そう、モンスター娘様とは、あのマイネートー様のような\n存在をさすのだと、私はそう信じていた。それなのに――。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "67bba24ed75e75351f48558efed763653b95ffe563d02b48e93c6e32db076976",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ああなんと淫らな気配……汚らわしい！\nもっと、もっと祈りを捧げ、次こそはあの紛い物どもを\nこの私の聖なる力で、浄化して差し上げましょう……。",
      "jp_sha256": "7241bba58e0f4bef689d55bfba7dd690e72be7dea839b8c7df72d1c75bc44415",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아아, 이 얼마나 음란한 기운…… 불결합니다!\n더, 더 기도를 바쳐 다음번에는 저 가짜들을\n이 몸의 성스러운 힘으로 정화해 드리겠습니다…….",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 34,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "9497a5804cf6d6776e1c95a88c40e70c7ac8d6e23986ba68b865e2b585ec4730:000000_-4531272953297824760:g0:r33",
      "row_index_0based": 33,
      "serialized_row_index": 33,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "聖女",
        "Emt2_Ang",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "ああなんと淫らな気配……汚らわしい！\nもっと、もっと祈りを捧げ、次こそはあの紛い物どもを\nこの私の聖なる力で、浄化して差し上げましょう……。",
        "",
